  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfenced></math> denote the greatest integer<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math>. Then the equation in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "p1YTB",
      "text": "exactly two solutions",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6FUB1",
      "text": "exactly four integral solutions",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3WM9U",
      "text": "no integral solution",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5QVVn",
      "text": "infinitely many solutions",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, equation has infinitely many solutions.</p>",
